    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10255" root="خرب" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَارِبٌ</span></b>  <i>A stealer of camels:</i> (As, S, A:) and
(by extension of its original meaning, TA) <i>any
thief,</i> or <i>robber:</i> (JK, S:) dim. ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُوَيْرِبٌ</span></b> : (TA:)
and pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُرَّابٌ</span>, (S, A, TA,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخْرَابٌ</span>. (JK.)
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِرْبَةٌ</span>.]

